&gt;An expert with the think tank Clean Energy  Canada, said Ottawa is not in a position to dictate emissions standards  on its own. **But combined with California and the other states, these  jurisdictions represent about half the North American market.** That could  encourage most automakers to decide it makes more sense adhere to the  stricter standards, rather than craft different lines of production for  two sets of rules, he said.  
